---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Support — DiskPrune"
  description="Email support@diskprune.com. License keys arrive from licenses@diskprune.com, never on the success page."
>
  <main class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Support</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Email <a href="mailto:support@diskprune.com">support@diskprune.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Include the email you used at checkout if the question is about a missing license key.
      We never put the key on the success page or in a URL — check spam for
      licenses@diskprune.com.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      DiskPrune moves files to Trash only. It does not empty Trash, permanently delete, or
      delete APFS snapshots. The app is notarized by Apple: on first launch macOS asks
      whether to open an app downloaded from the internet — click Open.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      Founding price not showing at checkout? Click <strong>Add promotion code</strong> on the
      Stripe page and type <span class="coupon text-ink">FOUNDING</span>. It is limited to the
      first 100 customers.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
      <a href="/refunds">Refund policy</a>
      ·
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
